<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL EX WANTS HIGHER LIMIT FOR ADRS.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL EX WANTS HIGHER LIMIT FOR ADRS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's Mostostal Export construction and trading firm said on Thursday it had asked the Polish Securities Commission (KPW) to raise the limit for its ADR issues to 25 percent from present five percent of capital.</p>
<p>Mostostal Export said in a statement it was seeking the increase becasue of active turnover in its American Depositary Receipts and a plan to introduce the receipts to Frankfurt and Berlin stock exchanges. The statement gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
